{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/38807-half-demons","id":38807,"title":"Half-Demons","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-29T12:09:16-08:00","id":38807,"title":"Half-Demons","content":"Nomen est omen:<br /> <br /> How do you depict them in your head-canon? I know there has not been said much about them in the book, but I'd like to do a half-Demon-chronicle and I wanted to ask, what you guys thought of the following tweaks.<br /> <br /> First of all: Half-Demon are all born with a minor Glitch. A Stigma, that sets them apart from normal children and makes them stand out forever.<br /> Second: They have access to some of the demonic powers. Still considering whether to allow them watered down demonic forms, or leave it with access to their parents Embeds and eventually Exploits.<br /> I'd also like to give them their own Primum, but I'm still figuring out, what kind of power-level I want to ST...<br /> <br /> Any thoughts on it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/492-rerave","name":"ReRave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar492_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-29T12:27:09-08:00","id":38818,"title":"","content":"I haven't used them yet but just thinking about it I'd giver them Primum 0, a 10 point pool of Aether, Cover instead of integrity (although no natural ability to change it.), 1 Exploit, they ability to buy embeds but not Exploits, and their glitch relating to their parents demonic form.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/252-basketcase","name":"basketcase","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar252_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-29T18:54:53-08:00","id":39017,"title":"","content":"<i>Heirs to Hell </i>promises background and presumably rules for playing half-Demons. In the final copy of the DtD's PDF, it mentions that they don't have/need Cover like their Demon parents do, but that they can't use Exploits. It <i>does </i>say they can access some of the occult physics the God-Machine manipulates, which I personally understand as meaning Embeds.<br /> <br /> While I'm interested in waiting on <i>Heirs </i>I would just make them Mortals who can use Embeds.<br /> <br /> EDIT: I'd also make Embeds cost 3 Experiences for mortals. Maybe 4. It's probably much harder to learn them with your essentially human body, even if you've got a bit of the weird in you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-29T22:07:30-08:00","id":39136,"title":"","content":"I fully expect the Heirs to be more than just Stigmatics with Embeds, but I can't imagine what exactly that would be. I don't see them with Demonic Form abilities either.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-30T10:44:12-08:00","id":39480,"title":"","content":"Probably more involved than stigmatics with Embeds, yeah. More involved mechanically? Almost certainly. But we only have 30,000 words to work with, too. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-30T14:01:49-08:00","id":39571,"title":"","content":"Fingers crossed for cryptid pets.<br /> <br /> ...Didn't the kid in <i>Good Omens</i> have a pet hellhound?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-30T16:26:23-08:00","id":39679,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></di